1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,989
This little monster truck wants to make the biggest jump. But splat! He lands in the mud.

2
00:00:06,889 --> 00:00:08,650
Dot the digger rolls over to help.

3
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:13,136
Rocco tries again and again. Whee! He flies!

4
00:00:14,036 --> 00:00:16,868
Then it's time for the big jump. Up, up, up!

5
00:00:17,768 --> 00:00:24,353
It's a story book your child colors, and reads. One big picture, one easy sentence on every page.

6
00:00:25,253 --> 00:00:28,103
For ages three to six. Link in bio!

